  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank Multi-Partner Trust Fund for Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Somalia):  To continue strengthening the Government of Somalia&apos;s ability to deliver sound governance and oversee the delivery of key services to its citizens, USAID will strengthen public financial management systems, domestic revenue mobilization, expenditure control, and accountability in the Federal Government of Somalia and Federal Member States. USAID will focus on building the capacity of resource management systems, the intergovernmental fiscal framework, and support the delivery of key services including health and education. At the same time, USAID will enhance accountability around the delivery of those key services. This activity is implemented through a Public International Organization Agreement with the World Bank..</narrative>
  </description>
